    </section>

    <!-- Toolkit Section -->
    <section id="tools" class="py-5" style="padding-top: 50px !important; padding-bottom: 50px !important;">
        <div class="container-xl">
            <div class="mb-5" data-reveal>
                <span class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--omm-clay-500); letter-spacing: 0.08em;">The toolkit</span>
                <h2 class="display-6 font-display fw-bold text-dark mt-2">Six instruments for one job: knowing where you stand.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-reveal>
                    <a href="/mines" class="text-decoration-none">
                        <div class="omm-card omm-card-hover p-4 h-100">
                            <div class="d-inline-flex p-3 rounded-3 bg-dark text-warning mb-3">
                                <i class="ti ti-shovel fs-4 omm-icon-interactive"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Mine Board</h5>
                            <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">Track every asset you own - EPF, fixed deposits, stocks, property, gold - in one dashboard with live valuation and growth.</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-reveal>
                    <a href="/burdens" class="text-decoration-none">
                        <div class="omm-card omm-card-hover p-4 h-100">
                            <div class="d-inline-flex p-3 rounded-3 bg-dark text-warning mb-3">
                                <i class="ti ti-scale fs-4 omm-icon-interactive"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Burden Tracker</h5>
                            <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">See every loan and debt mapped against the mine it funds. Watch your burden shrink as your mine grows.</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-reveal>
                    <a href="/income" class="text-decoration-none">
                        <div class="omm-card omm-card-hover p-4 h-100">
                            <div class="d-inline-flex p-3 rounded-3 bg-dark text-warning mb-3">
                                <i class="ti ti-trending-up fs-4 omm-icon-interactive"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Income Classifier</h5>
                            <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">Split income into Active, Passive, and Non-recurring. Know exactly how much of your life is funded by your mines.</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-reveal>
                    <a href="/goals" class="text-decoration-none">
                        <div class="omm-card omm-card-hover p-4 h-100">
                            <div class="d-inline-flex p-3 rounded-3 bg-dark text-warning mb-3">
                                <i class="ti ti-target fs-4 omm-icon-interactive"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Goal Mining</h5>
                            <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">Set wealth goals with target dates and link them to specific mines. Get milestone alerts as you close the gap.</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-reveal>
                    <a href="/tools" class="text-decoration-none">
                        <div class="omm-card omm-card-hover p-4 h-100">
                            <div class="d-inline-flex p-3 rounded-3 bg-dark text-warning mb-3">
                                <i class="ti ti-shield-check fs-4 omm-icon-interactive"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Safety Net Planner</h5>
                            <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">Calculate your emergency fund target based on recurring expenses and current passive income coverage.</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-reveal>
                    <a href="/dashboard" class="text-decoration-none">
                        <div class="omm-card omm-card-hover p-4 h-100">
                            <div class="d-inline-flex p-3 rounded-3 bg-dark text-warning mb-3">
                                <i class="ti ti-layers-intersect fs-4 omm-icon-interactive"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Net Wealth View</h5>
                            <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">Total mines minus total burdens, updated as values change. The single number that tells you where you stand.</p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Concepts Section -->
    <section id="concepts" class="py-5 bg-white border-top border-bottom">
        <div class="container-xl py-4">
            <div class="mb-5" data-reveal>
                <span class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--omm-clay-500); letter-spacing: 0.08em;">The ideas</span>
                <h2 class="display-6 font-display fw-bold text-dark mt-2">The mining metaphor is the whole interface.</h2>
                <p class="text-muted mt-3" style="font-size: 1.05rem;">
                    Not branding. Not a mascot. The metaphor shapes how every number is presented, how every screen is organised, and how you think about your financial life.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-6" data-reveal>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-3 p-3 text-warning bg-dark" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; flex-shrink: 0;">
                            <i class="ti ti-shovel fs-4"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Everything you own is a Mine</h5>
                            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                                A mine produces value over time. Your EPF account, fixed deposits, stocks, rental property, gold bars - each is a mine yielding returns.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6" data-reveal>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-3 p-3 text-danger bg-danger-subtle" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; flex-shrink: 0;">
                            <i class="ti ti-scale fs-4"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Everything you owe is a Burden</h5>
                            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                                A burden weighs on your mines. Mortgages, car loans, credit card balances, PTPTN - each burden is linked to the mine it is tied to.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6" data-reveal>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-3 p-3 text-success bg-success-subtle" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; flex-shrink: 0;">
                            <i class="ti ti-trending-up fs-4"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Active vs Passive Income</h5>
                            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                                Active income stops when you stop working. Passive income comes from your mines - rent, dividends, interest. The shift is freedom.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6" data-reveal>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-3 p-3 text-primary bg-primary-subtle" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; flex-shrink: 0;">
                            <i class="ti ti-sun fs-4"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Freedom Ratio</h5>
                            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                                Passive income divided by recurring expenses. At 100%, your mines cover your life. OhMyMine tracks this front and centre.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6" data-reveal>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-3 p-3 text-info bg-info-subtle" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; flex-shrink: 0;">
                            <i class="ti ti-target fs-4"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Goal Mining</h5>
                            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                                Wealth without a target is just a number. Set goals and link them to the mines that will get you there.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6" data-reveal>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-3 p-3 text-secondary bg-secondary-subtle" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; flex-shrink: 0;">
                            <i class="ti ti-compass fs-4"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">A Compass, Not a Map</h5>
                            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                                OhMyMine gives you clarity on where you are, so you can make your own financial decisions with confidence.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Malaysia Instruments Section -->
    <section id="malaysia" class="py-5">
        <div class="container-xl py-4">
            <div class="mb-5" data-reveal>
                <span class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--omm-clay-500); letter-spacing: 0.08em;">Made for Malaysia</span>
                <h2 class="display-6 font-display fw-bold text-dark mt-2">Malaysian financial instruments, first-class citizens.</h2>
                <p class="text-muted mt-3" style="font-size: 1.05rem;">
                    OhMyMine is built around the instruments Malaysians actually use - not generic categories retrofitted to a local context.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-reveal>
                    <div class="omm-card p-4 h-100">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                            <div class="p-2 rounded-3 bg-success-subtle text-success">
                                <i class="ti ti-shield-lock fs-5"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0 text-dark">EPF / KWSP</h6>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                            Your largest mine for most Malaysians. Track Account 1 and Account 2 balances, dividend history, and payout projections.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-reveal>
                    <div class="omm-card p-4 h-100">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                            <div class="p-2 rounded-3 bg-success-subtle text-success">
                                <i class="ti ti-building-bank fs-5"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0 text-dark">Fixed Deposits</h6>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                            Compare placement rates across CIMB, Maybank, Public Bank, RHB. Track maturity dates so you never roll over at a low rate.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-reveal>
                    <div class="omm-card p-4 h-100">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                            <div class="p-2 rounded-3 bg-success-subtle text-success">
                                <i class="ti ti-home-dollar fs-5"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0 text-dark">Property & Mortgage</h6>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                            Link your property to its mortgage burden. See rental yield against monthly instalment in one unified view.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-reveal>
                    <div class="omm-card p-4 h-100">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                            <div class="p-2 rounded-3 bg-success-subtle text-success">
                                <i class="ti ti-coins fs-5"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0 text-dark">Gold (GAA / Passbook)</h6>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                            Track Maybank Gold Investment Account and physical gold holdings by weight. See gains in MYR as gold prices move.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-reveal>
                    <div class="omm-card p-4 h-100">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                            <div class="p-2 rounded-3 bg-danger-subtle text-danger">
                                <i class="ti ti-school fs-5"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0 text-dark">PTPTN</h6>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                            Track your education loan balance and repayment progress. See it as a burden with a clear payoff timeline.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-reveal>
                    <div class="omm-card p-4 h-100">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                            <div class="p-2 rounded-3 bg-success-subtle text-success">
                                <i class="ti ti-chart-pie fs-5"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0 text-dark">Bursa Malaysia</h6>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                            Log stock and REIT holdings with purchase price and live values. Dividends flow into your passive income total automatically.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About & Principles Dark Section -->
    <section id="about" class="gradient-dark py-5 position-relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="position-absolute top-0 start-0 end-0 bottom-0 grid-pattern-dark opacity-30"></div>
        <div class="container-xl py-5 position-relative">
            <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
                <div class="col-lg-6" data-reveal>
                    <span class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--omm-clay-500); letter-spacing: 0.08em;">About</span>
                    <h2 class="display-6 font-display fw-bold text-white mt-2">A compass, not a salesperson.</h2>
                    <p class="text-white-50 mt-4 lead" style="line-height: 1.6;">
                        OhMyMine exists because personal finance tools either push products, hide behind jargon, or treat every country as identical. This one does none of those things.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-white-50" style="line-height: 1.6;">
                        It is a workspace for thinking clearly about what you have, what you owe, and where your income actually comes from. No recommendations. No referrals. Just clarity.
                    </p>
                </div>

